                       I thought these verses were really interesting! They are saying that  prophets are types of Christ. I think about all of the prophets who  testified and we persecuted, just like Christ was when he was on the  earth. I think of Alma and Amulek when they were in prison, I think of  Noah who the people didn't listen to, and I think of Joseph Smith who  was martyred for the Gospel, similar to Jesus.
                       <br><br>
                       Pretty interesting.
